  "question": "Where\u2019s the closest restaurant lying along the route toward Mary Prentiss Inn, Cambridge, MA from Cyrus Dallin Art Museum, Arlington, MA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.15241 42.415769)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.118995 42.384295)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.15241 42.415769)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.15241 42.415769)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
